          "notes_base": "Same resort as Day 2. After Jade Snow Mountain (玉龙雪山) and Blue Moon Valley (蓝月谷) day trip, return to this luxurious pastoral retreat to unwind. The resort's spa is perfect for tired legs after a day at altitude. Est. 1500-2200 CNY/night.",
